{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":490306,"name":"Ricardo Daud","username":"Ricardo_Daud","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/df788c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:17.081Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490306-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490306-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490306-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490306-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot computer view is blank; agent can still see the desktop.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe in-app Computer / Take over viewer is blank.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe bot can screenshot DISPLAY=:1 and confirms an IBKR Gateway login window is on screen (~790×610).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInternal stack: Xvfb :1 → x11vnc 127.0.0.1:5900 → noVNC 0.0.0.0:6080.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eContainer has no sshd; 6080 is not reachable from my Mac.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI need the viewer (keyboard) to finish IB Gateway Paper login so API 4002 can open.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePlease do not reset the Agent Computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot version: 0.47.0\u003cbr\u003e\nApp OS: macOS Apple Silicon\u003cbr\u003e\nBot computer: Linux container\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490306-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490306-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot on macOS (Apple Silicon) and open the Computer / Take over view for this bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe in-app viewer is blank (no desktop, no keyboard).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIn the same session, ask the bot to inspect its own display.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThe bot reports DISPLAY=:1 is up, IBKR Gateway login window is visible on the virtual desktop (~790×610), x11vnc on 127.0.0.1:5900 and noVNC on :6080.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eI still cannot see or type in that window from the Grok Bot app. The container has no sshd, so I cannot open :6080 from my Mac either.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490306-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490306-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eComputer / Take over should show the bot’s virtual desktop and let me use the keyboard/mouse, so I can complete on-screen logins. Screenshots from the bot and the live viewer should match.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490306-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490306-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMacOS\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490306-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490306-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot 0.20.0\u003cbr\u003e\nRelease Track: stable\u003cbr\u003e\nOS: darwin (macOS Apple Silicon)\u003cbr\u003e\nBot computer: Linux container (viewer target)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-490306-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-490306-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo - Cursor works, but with this issue\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:59:25.946Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":5,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":26.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171555,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-viewer-blank","display_username":"Ricardo Daud","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137634,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-viewer-blank/171555/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":490435,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T06:25:53.218Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey, \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ricardo_daud\"\u003e@Ricardo_Daud\u003c/a\u003e, thanks for the detailed report.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFirst, the good news. On our side, your bot’s computer is working fine and has been the whole time, so there’s no need to reset anything. Your bots, files, and the IB Gateway window are safe. What’s failing is the live screen connection from your Mac to that computer. That’s separate from the chat connection, so the bot can still see its own screen, but the viewer shows nothing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease try these in order and tell me where anything changes:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit Grok Bot (Grok Bot menu \u0026gt; Quit, not just closing the window), then open it again.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen the bot and click the screen preview (or the Take over button) to open Computer view. Wait 30 seconds.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTell me what the view shows exactly. Is it a completely black screen, a message like “Can’t reach …’s screen” with a Retry button, or “Starting desktop”?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnect your Mac to your phone’s hotspot instead of your normal Wi‑Fi, repeat steps 1 to 2, and tell me if the desktop appears.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf you have the Grok Bot app on your phone, open the same bot there and tap its screen. If the desktop shows up on the phone, you can finish the IB Gateway login from there.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, please tell me if you’re using a VPN, proxy, custom DNS (like 1.1.1.1 or 8.8.8.8 on your Mac or router), iCloud Private Relay, antivirus, or any security tools on your Mac.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAbout the version, the report shows both 0.47.0 and 0.20.0. The current version is 0.47.0, and it matches what we see, so no update is needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet me know how it goes, and I’ll suggest the next steps based on what you see.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T06:25:53.218Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":171555,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-viewer-blank","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-viewer-blank/171555/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":490798,"name":"Ricardo Daud","username":"Ricardo_Daud","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/df788c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T12:08:17.965Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/4/2413db6631b7b22b528fd9a5d8127a2c0480c953.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/599JpqPEG8HPi2k1zzIa6Vzscin.jpeg?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/4/2413db6631b7b22b528fd9a5d8127a2c0480c953_2_535x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"599JpqPEG8HPi2k1zzIa6Vzscin\" width=\"535\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/4/2413db6631b7b22b528fd9a5d8127a2c0480c953_2_535x500.jpeg, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/4/2413db6631b7b22b528fd9a5d8127a2c0480c953_2_802x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/2/4/2413db6631b7b22b528fd9a5d8127a2c0480c953_2_1070x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"BFBFBF\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1920×1794 94.3 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003eJust blank\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T12:08:17.965Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":5.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171555,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-viewer-blank","display_username":"Ricardo Daud","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137634,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-viewer-blank/171555/6","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":490947,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T14:56:13.789Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks for the screenshot, that’s the key detail. What you’re seeing isn’t a viewer bug or a black screen. The viewer is connected and is rendering the bot machine’s desktop (gray wallpaper, Chrome and a terminal at the bottom). So the live screen connection from your Mac is working fine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe problem is elsewhere. The IBKR Gateway window is not on the desktop that Take over is showing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom your description, the bot started a separate stack (\u003ccode\u003eXvfb :1\u003c/code\u003e → \u003ccode\u003ex11vnc 127.0.0.1:5900\u003c/code\u003e → \u003ccode\u003enoVNC :6080\u003c/code\u003e) and launched IBKR on \u003ccode\u003eDISPLAY=:1\u003c/code\u003e. But Take over is showing the machine’s main desktop, the one in the screenshot. These are two different displays. The bot “sees” its window on \u003ccode\u003e:1\u003c/code\u003e, but in the viewer you’re looking at an empty main desktop. That’s why the bot screenshot and the live viewer don’t match.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat to try:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsk the bot to open something visible (for example, a terminal) on the main desktop, the one shown in Take over. If it appears in the viewer, you’re finally looking at the same display.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThen ask the bot to start IBKR Gateway on that same main display, without its own \u003ccode\u003eXvfb :1\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003ex11vnc\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003enoVNC\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter that, the IBKR window should show up in Take over, and you can finish the Paper login using your keyboard.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBased on the screenshot, the network side already looks fine, so you can pause the hotspot steps for now. This really looks like a display issue where IBKR is being launched. Let me know what happens.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T14:56:13.789Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":6,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":5.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171555,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-viewer-blank","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","reply_to_user":{"id":137634,"username":"Ricardo_Daud","name":"Ricardo Daud","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/df788c/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-viewer-blank/171555/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":491123,"name":"Ricardo Daud","username":"Ricardo_Daud","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/df788c/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T18:11:11.002Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks…it worked. Anyway it would be useful to have a conector for this app as in Grok.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":8,"post_type":1,"posts_count":5,"updated_at":"2026-09-14T18:11:11.196Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":7,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":45.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171555,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-viewer-blank","display_username":"Ricardo Daud","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137634,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":"Automatically removed quote of whole previous post.","can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-viewer-blank/171555/8","reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":