een":false,"pinned":false,"unpinned":null,"excerpt":"Where does the bug appear (feature/product)?\nGrok Bot \nDescribe the Bug\nGrok Bot desktop on Windows will not finish setup. \nPlan: SuperGrok \nPrivacy Mode is Active. \nAfter sign-in I get “Can’t reach your computer right n\u0026hellip;","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"bookmarked":null,"liked":null,"thumbnails":null,"tags":[{"id":416,"name":"grok-bot","slug":"grok-bot"},{"id":408,"name":"networking","slug":"networking"},{"id":308,"name":"privacy-mode","slug":"privacy-mode"}],"tags_descriptions":{},"like_count":0,"views":82,"category_id":6,"featured_link":null,"op_like_count":0,"has_accepted_answer":false,"posters":[{"extras":null,"description":"Original Poster","user":{"id":135653,"username":"alex_kagianaris","name":"alex kagianaris","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/a/f0a364/{size}.png","trust_level":0}},{"extras":null,"description":"Recent Poster","user":{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_group_id":42,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4}},{"extras":"latest","description":"Most Recent Poster","user":{"id":87436,"username":"Colin","name":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_group_id":42,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":3}}]}],"summarizable":false,"has_cached_summary":false,"valid_reactions":["heart","+1","crossed_fingers","clap","laughing","open_mouth","confetti_ball","hugs","heavy_plus_sign","heart_eyes","sunglasses","cursor"],"accepted_answers":[{"id":490947,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-14T14:56:13.789Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks for the screenshot, that’s the key detail. What you’re seeing isn’t a viewer bug or a black screen. The viewer is connected and is rendering the bot machine’s desktop (gray wallpaper, Chrome and a terminal at the bottom). So the live screen connection from your Mac is working fine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe problem is elsewhere. The IBKR Gateway window is not on the desktop that Take over is showing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFrom your description, the bot started a separate stack (\u003ccode\u003eXvfb :1\u003c/code\u003e → \u003ccode\u003ex11vnc 127.0.0.1:5900\u003c/code\u003e → \u003ccode\u003enoVNC :6080\u003c/code\u003e) and launched IBKR on \u003ccode\u003eDISPLAY=:1\u003c/code\u003e. But Take over is showing the machine’s main desktop, the one in the screenshot. These are two different displays. The bot “sees” its window on \u003ccode\u003e:1\u003c/code\u003e, but in the viewer you’re looking at an empty main desktop. That’s why the bot screenshot and the live viewer don’t match.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhat to try:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsk the bot to open something visible (for example, a terminal) on the main desktop, the one shown in Take over. If it appears in the viewer, you’re finally looking at the same display.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThen ask the bot to start IBKR Gateway on that same main display, without its own \u003ccode\u003eXvfb :1\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003ex11vnc\u003c/code\u003e / \u003ccode\u003enoVNC\u003c/code\u003e.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAfter that, the IBKR window should show up in Take over, and you can finish the Paper login using your keyboard.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBased on the screenshot, the network side already looks fine, so you can pause the hotspot steps for now. This really looks like a display issue where IBKR is being launched. Let me know what happens.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"topic_id":171555,"url":"/t/grok-bot-viewer-blank/171555/7","accepter_name":"Ricardo Daud","accepter_username":"Ricardo_Daud"}],"has_accepted_answer":true,"can_create_shared_issue":false,"shared_issue_visible":false,"can_vote":false,"vote_count":0,"user_voted":false,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_id":null,"discourse_zendesk_plugin_zendesk_url":"https://your-url.zendesk.com/agent/tickets/","details":{"can_edit":false,"notification_level":1,"participants":[{"id":137634,"username":"Ricardo_Daud","name":"Ricardo Daud","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/df788c/{size}.png","post_count":3,"primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"trust_level":0},{"id":750,"username":"deanrie","name":"Dean Rie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","post_count":2,"primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_color":"","flair_bg_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"admin":true,"moderator":true,"trust_level":4}],"created_by":{"id":137634,"username":"Ricardo_Daud","name":"Ricardo Daud","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/df788c/{size}.png"},"last_poster":{"id":137634,"username":"Ricardo_Daud","name":"Ricardo Daud","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/df788c/{size}.png"}},"bookmarks":[]}